  - I was four in the Great Rains; I remember being carried above brown water and a pale coin burning in the Rose when the sky had none.
  - I heard the Hammering from inside the anchorhold: stone, roof, screaming, and then voices at my squint naming the missing until dark.
  - I, Aldith, lay down at the end of an ordinary day.
